#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid "Gamepad"
msgstr "Gamepad"

#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid ""
"Provides support for using gamepads as input devices: pan, zoom and switch "
"panes, tabs and series items with a game controller."
msgstr ""
"Ermöglicht die Verwendung von Gamepads als Eingabegeräte: Verschieben, "
"Zoomen und Wechseln zwischen Bereichen, Tabs und Serienelementen mit einem "
"Gamecontroller."

#. Translators: the horizontal (X) axis of the left stick of a game
#. controller; keep the letter X
#: src/config.rs:136
msgid "Left Stick X"
msgstr "Linker Stick X"

#. Translators: the vertical (Y) axis of the left stick
#: src/config.rs:138
msgid "Left Stick Y"
msgstr "Linker Stick Y"

#. Translators: the horizontal (X) axis of the right stick
#: src/config.rs:140
msgid "Right Stick X"
msgstr "Rechter Stick X"

#. Translators: the vertical (Y) axis of the right stick
#: src/config.rs:142
msgid "Right Stick Y"
msgstr "Rechter Stick Y"

#. Translators: the analog trigger under the left shoulder (LT, L2)
#: src/config.rs:144
msgid "Left Trigger"
msgstr "Linker Trigger"

#. Translators: the analog trigger under the right shoulder (RT, R2)
#: src/config.rs:146
msgid "Right Trigger"
msgstr "Rechter Trigger"

#. Translators: D-Pad is the directional pad, the cross of four
#. buttons on the left of a game controller
#: src/config.rs:149
msgid "D-Pad Left"
msgstr "Steuerkreuz links"

#: src/config.rs:150
msgid "D-Pad Right"
msgstr "Steuerkreuz rechts"

#: src/config.rs:151
msgid "D-Pad Up"
msgstr "Steuerkreuz oben"

#: src/config.rs:152
msgid "D-Pad Down"
msgstr "Steuerkreuz unten"

#. Translators: the four face buttons are named by their position:
#. the bottom one (A on Xbox, Cross on PlayStation, B on Nintendo)
#: src/config.rs:155
msgid "South Button"
msgstr "Taste unten"

#. Translators: the right face button (B on Xbox, Circle on PlayStation)
#: src/config.rs:157
msgid "East Button"
msgstr "Taste rechts"

#. Translators: the top face button (Y on Xbox, Triangle on PlayStation)
#: src/config.rs:159
